# LIBRARY: own
# A read of a field that the object does not have yet finds its slot empty and returns undefined as long as the class guard for that name holds.
# A value that the program stores on the prototype must be found.
# The load itself is not checked when the slot is empty, because it may be placed before the guards that give the empty slot its meaning.
# With testing=CheckWalkAtRunTime the check is placed after the read, where the program has the read.
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
